  "_comment": [
    "Feed-shaped sources. Adding an outlet is a line here, not a new fetcher.",
    "`hint` is a category from categorize.CATEGORIES, applied when neither the",
    "keyword pass nor the LLM has a better idea - a robotics trade publication",
    "is about robotics even when a given headline doesn't say so.",
    "`title_prefix` names the project on feeds whose titles don't (GitHub releases).",
    "Feeds verified reachable on 2026-09-19 (robot-learning feeds on 2026-10-06); a dead one fails soft and is",
    "reported by `cli fetch`, it never breaks the run."
